 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Via Truth Social 🤬 President Trump lashed out at the Supreme Court after it struck down his mail-in voting order. Trump wrote on Truth Social: "These are not the people I interviewed to serve on the United States Supreme Court." Go deeper . 💥 The U.S. military destroyed two small Iranian boats after the Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps tried to steal a Navy drone patrolling the Strait of Hormuz, U.S. officials tell Axios' Barak Ravid. Go deeper . ❤️ Savannah Guthrie says she was "touched" by actress Allison Janney's comments at the Emmy Awards about her missing mother. Guthrie said on Today: "We just want our mom home, give her a proper goodbye, that's all." Watch . 
 
